{
  "title": "Sex-specific urine concentrating index calibration fails to establish added predictive value across NHANES cycles",
  "abstract": "In NHANES2009\u201310 source and2011\u201312 external-cycle complete-case adults (n=5362/4584), sex-specific log-UCI splines reduced target weighted MSE by 58.256(mOsm/kg)\u00b2 (0.264%), but the source-refit/target-PSU bootstrap95% interval was [-92.989,164.927]; added predictive value was not established.",
